      "text": "\u2733\nPair Play\nA LITTLE MOMENT OF FOCUS\nPlay\nProgress\nHistory\n\nTHE ORCHARD COLLECTION \u00b7 01\n\nGood things\ncome in pairs.\n6\n\nPAIRS\nRound in progress\n1 turn \u00b7 0/6 pairs\n01\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf4a\nOrange\n02\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf53\nStrawberry\n03\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf49\nWatermelon\n04\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf53\nStrawberry\n05\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf47\nGrapes\n06\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf4e\nApple\n07\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf49\nWatermelon\n08\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf4a\nOrange\n09\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf4e\nApple\n10\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf4c\nBanana\n11\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf47\nGrapes\n12\n\u2605\n\ud83c\udf4c\nBanana\n\nA fresh look. A familiar pair.\nFlip two cards. Match the fruit. Find all six pairs.\n\n\u25cb\nSaved round loaded\nYour next visit starts here.\n\nYOUR ROUND\n\n1\nturn\nEvery two flips count as one.\nLittle by little\n0 / 6\n\n6 more pairs waiting to be found.\n\n\u00b7\n\u00b7\n\u00b7\n\u00b7\n\u00b7\n\u00b7\n\u2667\nPERSONAL BEST\nYours to set\n\nFinish a round to make your mark.\n\nYour completed rounds\n\u2197\n\u21bb New round\nMake it yours\n\uff0b\n\u2733\n\nNo clock. No rush.\nJust a little room to focus.\n\nTWELVE CARDS. SIX CONNECTIONS.\nTake your time. Find your rhythm.",
